WEBVTT

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:16.770
Elysium...

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:23.650
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:29.830
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:50.260
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:57.310
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.230
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:04.320
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.150
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:09.740
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.240
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:13.910
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:22.750
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:27.760
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:36.600
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:40.730
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:21.020
He was still alive?

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:26.110
It's merely the Tribe of Iron!

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.030
Where did they go?

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.950
See? We got out!

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:41.670
Let... Let me rest for a second!

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:51.010
Y-You bastards!

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:56.680
A Tribe of Silver ship...
Did we get out of that nothingness?

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.350
The path to Elysium has been indicated.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:03.770
We'll head to that planet in
this ship while we regain our strength.

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:07.110
A-Are you going to betray us?

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:10.690
You have it wrong, Phaetho O.

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:14.740
We haven't done anything
to breach the agreements.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:18.290
The majority of the Tribe of Silver
agreed with Prome-sama.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:22.660
The ones who continue to resist
are people like you and Rom Ror.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:28.960
Rom Ror will make Yuty destroy the planet
once he realizes that he won't get the power.

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:31.510
That is the last agreement Yuty has.

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:35.430
And to protect the power that lies in
that planet is the agreement that I have,

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:39.010
as well as my mission.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.810
Elysium.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.640
The path has been discovered.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.980
You should listen to them.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:51.490
Go. Not only for you and your tribe,
but for all the tribes in this universe.

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:55.700
Or would you rather
challenge all of us here instead?

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:09.420
Rom Ror and his Nodos will
destroy all of you bastards!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:15.220
Stars, be their guide.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:21.890
Elysium... It's nothing but an illusion.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:27.900
The Tribe of Gold didn't leave
a thing for us, the Tribe of Silver.

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:31.480
Now it's come to this,
there's no need to even leave a memory

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:33.860
that the tribe ever existed.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:44.120
Erase me... I won't forgive you...
Erase me... Kervius... Please erase me....

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:59.340
It's getting closer... It's over there...

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.430
What's the situation?

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:04.350
Repairs are expected to take
at least eighty hours, Master.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:07.140
And we can't warp until
the repair is done, huh?

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.770
No, Master.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.520
We did make a cease-fire
with the Tribe of Silver,

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:14.110
but there's no guarantee that
dissidents won't come after us.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.070
We'll do everything we
can to keep on heading towards

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.990
the coordinates indicated by the princess.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.910
We're detecting a field that's
similar to a magnetic storm.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:23.080
It's expected to be an obstacle on our course.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.700
No alternate route, huh?

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.660
That's nothing we can't burst through.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:31.080
Charge at full speed! Maintain the shield!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.220
This is...

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:46.770
Our speed is deteriorating rapidly!

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:50.980
The navigation is being
hampered by an unknown force!

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.940
It's not just a magnetic storm?

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.280
A part of the magnetic storm
has gone through the shield

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:58.360
and is aggravating the damage on the ship!
We're unable to stop it!

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.540
It's testing us...

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.510
The interior of the ship has been damaged!

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:22.300
At this rate, the ship will be disabled!

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:24.180
The unknown field has
gotten even more powerful!

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:28.310
It'll reach the shield's
endurance limit in seven hundred seconds!

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:31.980
I guess we have no choice but to turn
around for now and repair the ship.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:33.560
No, Captain.

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:34.980
Princess!

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:38.990
Receiving data though the psycholine.
Projecting the analysis results.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:45.660
What? That's not the ship course? What the...

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:48.870
Delphi has approved unlocking the frame.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:54.380
Y-You're ordering us to deploy the
main cannon of the Argonaut? C-Captain?

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:59.010
That wasn't me! Princess,
what are you trying to do?

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:06.220
They're testing us. They're trying to see
if we can open up the path ahead on our own.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:09.680
I can't guarantee you how
this is going to turn out.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:13.100
Please believe in me for now.

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:21.740
She makes decisions more right and
more fearsome than any saint or dictator.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.120
Maintain the navigation and the shield!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.580
We will launch the
main cannon of the Argonaut

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.620
toward the point indicated by the princess!

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:30.870
C-Captain?!

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.620
Are you asking us to deploy the shield,
open up the ship, take aim,

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:37.710
contain the recoil, and control
the power usage all at one time?

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:41.840
Forget about maintaining our course,
one mistake will tear the whole ship apart!

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:46.090
Has the princess ever asked us to
do the impossible even once before?!

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:53.020
Right now she's asking us
to use something that

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:55.900
she's always refused to let us use before.

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:59.980
Don't you think this is the time for us to
rise to the occasion with all we've got?!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:08.660
Confining the shield to the center.
Preparing to open the ship.

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:12.500
Synchronizing all power and navigation
controls with the alignment of the main cannon.

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:16.370
We'll give top priority to the hull opening
and proceed according to the simulations.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.460
Position all the functioning Organ units near

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:22.340
the parts which are
expected to receive damage.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:26.220
We're about to find out the
true worth of this journey.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:33.430
Begin opening the outer hull plates!

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:37.600
Unlocking the broadside lock!
Beginning the first phase of the deployment!

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:46.950
Outer hull unlocked on both sides. Moving
on to the second phase of the deployment.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.740
Unlocking the median axis line!

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:52.160
The outer hull plates and sails
on both sides are now fully open.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:55.750
Notice from the bridge.
All units deploy your shields!

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:08.430
No! You can't break on me!

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:12.810
This is not going to work! Princess!

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:16.980
Retracting the protective walls
in the bow and exposing the muzzle.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:25.360
All locks have been checked.
The outer hull plates are open!

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.780
The communications system is down.

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:28.410
Route optimizer is down.
 The communications system is down.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:29.610
Route optimizer is down.
 Switching to the backup system.

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.370
Requesting permission to
use the restricted circuit!
 Switching to the backup system.

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:33.160
We've finished deploying the main cannon.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:36.330
Maintaining the margin of error for
the alignment within minus two hundred points.

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:39.750
We've got a problem with the gravity controls!
It looks like we're going to lose the thrusters!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.840
It can only maintain the launching
posture for sixty seconds! Hurry up and aim!

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:47.340
Connecting the firing circuit!
Activating all accelerators!

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:50.550
I can feel the vibration even in this room.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:53.180
Try to concentrate more
energy on Dhianeila-sama!

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:56.180
At this rate her physical response
levels will become abnormal!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:10:02.190
Even if all of us collapse here, helping you
carry out your mission is the Lotus unit's...

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:04.610
it's my mission, Dhianeila-sama!

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:07.570
Target is locked on. Releasing the trigger lock.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:13.580
Handprint recognized. Releasing lock.
Approving the final code of the star blaster.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:17.830
Energy levels rising. Approximately
fifty seconds left until launch criticality.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:32.890
All accelerators functioning normally.
Ten seconds till criticality.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:33.930
Nine,

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:35.010
eight,

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:35.930
seven,

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:36.930
six,

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:37.890
five,

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:38.810
four,

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:39.890
three,

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:40.890
two,

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:42.270
one, zero!

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.940
The main cannon is ready to launch!

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:47.110
Main cannon, fire!

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.260
The main cannon was fired as aimed.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.930
Status of recoil control and
condition of the shield unknown!

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:17.930
The front thruster has been damaged.
The reserve pressure is gone.

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:21.230
We're going to recover the navigation
monitoring function using the backup circuit.

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:25.610
What's this...?

00:11:25.690 --> 00:11:27.770
The pressure outside
the ship is dropping rapidly!

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:31.950
We're navigating on the scheduled course
within a margin of error of minus .02 points.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:35.320
What is the meaning of this?
The ship is moving by itself?

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.780
We have detected a rapid
change in the unknown field.

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:41.830
It seems to be something that's
equivalent to gravitational pull.

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:45.290
A path of stars?

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:48.340
A starway was born.

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:04.480
Elysium.

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:10.150
So this is the mother planet
of the Tribe of Gold.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:11.650
It's beautiful.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:21.370
A Hedron shield...
The Tribe of Silver is here?

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.830
No, that's probably the original.

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:28.840
The origin of the technology that the
Tribe of Gold shared with the Tribe of Silver.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.470
It is welcoming us.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.100
Please prepare to descend, Captain.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.680
That's dangerous!

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:45.100
But I assume you'll still go down there
on your own no matter what I tell you...

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:49.610
Please wait a moment. I'll reorganize
the Organ unit for you right away.

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:52.030
Thank you very much, Captain.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:53.860
Dhianeila-sama.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:59.530
Thank you. I'd never have been
able to find the path or reach here

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:02.580
if I didn't have your support.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:09.290
Let's go. Allow me to
accompany you till the very end.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:10.340
Yes.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:16.050
Operational efficiency is down by half.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.090
Navigational error correction will be
disrupted until the front thruster is repaired.

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:23.430
Due to supply shortages, half of the 247
damaged blocks are unable to recover.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.390
Multiple areas of damage detected in the
defense functions on both sides of the ship.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:30.560
Due to energy consumption, our counterattack
capability has fallen below the standard level.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:33.650
But look at this.
It didn't tear this ship apart.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:37.530
I thank everyone's
exceptional operation skills.

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.410
Would you like to send the SOS signal?

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:44.740
It's too early to call this a ghost ship.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:49.370
It'll only end up luring the enemy.
Do not send the signal until the last minute.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.210
Start repairs beginning with the parts
that are necessary for navigation.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:56.840
They say that the descending
unit Basilis is ready to go, Master.

00:13:56.920 --> 00:14:01.050
The princess is finally going
to enter the territory of the gods.

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:03.930
Deploy as many Organ units as you
have available and be sure to protect her!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.520
The course is clear. Open the bay.
 Basilis is ready to move out.

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:16.030
We don't know how the Hedron shield
guarding the planet will react to this.

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:18.820
Be sure to stay alert, Iolaous.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:19.900
Roger.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.320
Ignite the engine. Move out!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:44.530
All descending units, change course.

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:10.890
The temperature and composition of
the atmosphere are changing rapidly.

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.980
Th-That's the optimum
composition for us to survive.

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:17.900
Let's go. You don't need to wear a suit.

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:20.980
Let's accept the welcome from this planet.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:25.910
Everyone just wait here.

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:27.240
Dhianeila-sama!

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:28.780
Take us at least!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.450
It's dangerous!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.410
There's no need to worry.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:36.000
I just want to feel the thoughts
that have been left on this planet.

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:42.760
Is she going to face this planet all by herself?

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:46.630
Be on high alert! Don't overlook any changes!

00:16:57.440 --> 00:17:05.530
Powerful thoughts... What moved you
to leave us this planet, Tribe of Gold?

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:19.960
To fill this universe with starways...

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.720
That's an illusion.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.770
Just like I thought, they did come follow us!

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:39.350
The enemy ship is invading
from the direction 01 .98!

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.270
Due to the loss of ships, no effective
counterattacking method is available to us!

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:44.230
I order the Organ units
on land to counterattack!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.530
Deploy your shield to its output limit!

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:48.200
Try to cut into the enemy's course!

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:51.910
The enemy has only one ship! Protect
the princess using our ships as a shield!

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.530
Dhianeila-sama!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.620
I want you to stand on this planet with me

00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:01.630
and try to feel the thoughts
that have been left for us.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:04.000
I've been searching for everything related to

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:09.180
the Tribe of Gold since
even before you showed up.

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:12.350
There's nothing left from them now.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:18.890
The Tribe of Gold fled this universe because
they feared being robbed of their power...

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:24.230
No, we weren't prepared to inherit the power.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:31.110
The Nodos are what they left for us.
Only the power to eliminate everything.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:34.990
That is the true intention of the Tribe of Gold.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.910
I don't care anymore...

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:45.130
Kervius... Just erase me
along with this suffering.

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:51.090
This planet itself is the proof
of something, as well as the path.

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:56.260
This planet is just further evidence
that the Tribe of Gold existed.

00:18:56.350 --> 00:19:00.230
And there's only one
reason why I was led here.

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:03.060
You must not!

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:07.190
To eliminate everything that's
related to the Tribe of Gold!

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.320
Kervius...

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:14.950
Concentrate on the shield as soon as
it contacts! You must hold it back!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:36.930
It protected us?

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:39.890
Unable to correct course!
We're going to crash on the planet!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:44.980
Open the hull plates as soon as we enter the
atmosphere! Diffuse the shock from the fall!

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:55.910
Do it, Yuty. That is your last agreement.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:09.300
Madness... You say that is the
true intention of the Tribe of Gold?

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:14.130
That destruction filled
with despair is our future?

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.340
Dhianeila-sama!

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:18.390
Argonaut is

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:19.810
It's going to fall!

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:26.850
All remaining thrusters have been damaged!

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.730
Concentrate the shield under the ship!

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:31.320
Maintain an oblique angle to the course
of our descent with the main engine!

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.740
The ship body is going to snap!

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:34.030
We're going to reach the surface!

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:36.490
Release all the bulkheads in the
compartments on both sides of the ship!

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:38.870
Try to ward off the shock with the entire ship!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:40.950
Don't give up until the end!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:15.990
Bee, what's the condition of the ship?

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.830
You did a good job, Bee...

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.910
Father.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:30.210
Tribe of Silver! He did that to the Argonaut!

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:38.930
Shit!

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:45.680
Even if he manages to destroy us,
the path to the future will never be cut off!

00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:51.480
Hopes will never be...

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:55.110
We're going to jump.

00:22:25.060 --> 00:22:33.190
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:33.270 --> 00:22:40.610
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:46.200
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:56.880
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:56.960 --> 00:23:09.480
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:20.820
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:26.160
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:32.710
